  "notes": "Learn by Doing now has rank progression routes for all 57 gameplay perks and five attributes. Weapon damage earns base practice; activity routes add practice, and ranks rise automatically when practice and native gates are met. Existing ranks are preserved, practice speed is adjustable, and unspent points are banked/restored with the setting. Movement, combat recovery, harvesting/digging, looting, trading, armor and lockpick routes are included. Specialty attribution and balance are ready for in-game playtesting.",
